@startuml UC-45
' Use case: ../use-cases/UC-45.md
title UC-45: Create / Update Product
footer Feature APRD-01 | Business rules: BR-07, BR-12, BR-14, BR-28
autonumber
hide footbox
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "Staff / Admin" as U
participant "Daisy.Mvc" as MVC
participant "Admin/ProductsController" as API <<Daisy.Api>>
participant "ProductService" as SVC <<Daisy.Application>>
database "DaisyDbContext" as DB <<SQL Server>>

note over API : Requires role: Staff, Admin

U -> MVC : Submit product form (category, name, slug, brand,\ndescription, material, gender target, base price)
alt new product
  MVC -> API : POST /api/admin/products
else existing product
  MVC -> API : PUT /api/admin/products/{id}
end
API -> SVC : SaveAsync(request)
SVC -> SVC : Validate input (BasePrice >= 0) (BR-14)
SVC -> DB : Any other product with the same Slug? (BR-12)
alt invalid input or duplicate slug
  SVC --> API : ValidationException / Conflict
  API --> MVC : 400 Bad Request / 409 Conflict
  MVC --> U : Show errors
else existing SalePrice > new BasePrice (BR-14)
  SVC --> API : BadRequest
  API --> MVC : 400 Bad Request
  MVC --> U : Show "Base price is below the current sale price"
else valid
  SVC -> DB : Insert or update product, UpdatedAt\nSaveChangesAsync
  note right of SVC : Existing orders keep their snapshots (BR-28)
  SVC --> API : ProductAdminDto
  API --> MVC : 200 OK / 201 Created
  MVC --> U : Show product; go on to variants (UC-47) and images (UC-48)
end

@enduml
